@baseUrl = http://localhost:5084

### Get all categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories


### Get category by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/4


### Create category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Category1",
    "description": "Description of category"
}


### Update category
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Premium Sports Bottles",
    "description": "Premium bottles for sports and outdoor activities"
}

//1  
### Delete category
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/4